diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index ddbf643..d1d749d 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,19 @@
+droidian-camera (26.1+s10plus3) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * PRO and PRO video run on a live Camera2 session: the viewfinder shows
+    manual ISO, shutter and focus, frames reach the GPU without copies
+    (AHardwareBuffer as EGLImage), the chips show the automatic values.
+  * Video through Camera2 (PRO video and plain video): hardware H.264/HEVC
+    from the camera into a persistent encoder surface, AAC sound, MP4 by
+    AMediaMuxer; manual ISO and shutter while recording, torch.
+  * Tap to focus and meter, exposure and white balance locks in the session.
+  * Record sound setting (on by default); hyperlapse and the software encoder
+    stay on Camera1 without sound, MediaRecorder cannot take the microphone.
+  * The screen does not blank while the camera is open (ScreenSaver inhibit):
+    a blanked screen throttles real-time threads and the camera drops frames.
+
+ -- Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 04:00:00 +0200
